{"id":"277c2ecce375c32e2d05f87ea98dc3b2bd498b44","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2026/oct/20/voter-issues-midterms-elections","title":"From Iran to AI: the six key voter issues shaping the US midterm elections","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"www.theguardian.com","byline":"Robert Tait","excerpt":"Much of Donald Trump’s unpopularity in polls stems from dissatisfaction over the economy and war on Iran US politics live – latest updates","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><article data-gu-name=\"body\"><div id=\"maincontent\"><figure id=\"a9c5be52-947b-4122-baf0-3f37730f43ae\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.InteractiveAtomBlockElement\"></figure><figure id=\"61988c72-986d-4839-9309-2145e851179e\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.EmbedBlockElement\"><gu-island name=\"UnsafeEmbedBlockComponent\" priority=\"feature\" deferUntil=\"visible\" props=\"{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;<div class=\\&quot;interactive\\&quot; data-props='{\\&quot;element\\&quot;:\\&quot;snap-slides\\&quot;,\\&quot;theme\\&quot;:\\&quot;feature-light\\&quot;}'></div>&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Layered red, white and blue paper cutouts depicting Trump, an ICE agent, a ballot box, a piggy bank, a fuel pump and a microchip&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:1,&quot;isTracking&quot;:false,&quot;isMainMedia&quot;:false}\"></gu-island></figure><hr><figure id=\"b4b541df-0d06-4381-bba2-ea90a2da15cc\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-1\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Colored Paper\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div><figcaption data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\"><span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 13\"><path d=\"M18 3.5v8l-1.5 1.5h-15l-1.5-1.5v-8l1.5-1.5h3.5l2-2h4l2 2h3.5l1.5 1.5zm-9 7.5c1.9 0 3.5-1.6 3.5-3.5s-1.6-3.5-3.5-3.5-3.5 1.6-3.5 3.5 1.6 3.5 3.5 3.5z\" /></svg></span> Illustration: Guardian Design</figcaption></figure><p>Next month’s<a href=\"https://viewer.gutools.co.uk/us-news/us-midterm-elections-2026\" data-link-name=\"in body link\"> midterm elections</a> will test <a href=\"https://viewer.gutools.co.uk/us-news/donaldtrump\" data-link-name=\"in body link\">Donald Trump’</a>s second term and determine whether Democrats regain political power in Washington. Polls show Trump’s approval ratings at their lowest across his two presidencies, pulled down by widespread economic dissatisfaction and an unpopular war against <a href=\"https://viewer.gutools.co.uk/world/iran\" data-link-name=\"in body link\">Iran</a>. Here are the key issues shaping this year’s elections.</p><hr><figure id=\"6d20e853-5e1e-4c9e-b625-527b49c6470d\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-2\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a piggy bank\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"the-economy\"><strong>The economy</strong></h2><p>Despite Trump’s 2024 campaign pledge to tackle affordability issues, the economy consistently ranks as voters’ top concern. A recent Associated Press-NORC survey showed only 26% of voters approving of Trump’s handling of the economy, two percentage points below Joe Biden’s worst ratings on the issue.</p><hr><figure id=\"954282a1-c877-457e-bd96-e3481f4c7443\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-3\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a fuel pump\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"iran\"><strong>Iran</strong></h2><p>Trump’s decision to go to war with the Tehran regime has exacerbated economic worries. Iran’s retaliatory decision to close the strait of Hormuz has driven up gasoline prices for US motorists.</p><p>It also represents a breach of his pledge to end the US’s supposed addiction to “forever wars”. Democrats and some Republicans also complain that he embarked on military action without congressional authorization.</p><hr><figure id=\"e97385b8-b6bd-45ad-b14d-1a5e260aac54\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-4\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of an ICE agent\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"immigration\"><strong>Immigration</strong></h2><p>Enforcement and closing the border remains a signature issue for Trump. He repeatedly boasts of the impact of his closure of the southern border as one of his biggest achievements, making comparisons with the performance of Joe Biden.</p><p>But the mood has since shifted. High profile violent incidents involving Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) and Customs and Border Protection agents have fed a perception that the immigration crackdown has “gone too far”.</p><hr><figure id=\"8b3fe089-0a25-49e3-aaf3-abd5df698cff\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-5\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of Trump’s profile\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"trumps-power\"><strong>Trump’s power</strong></h2><p>The president is not on the ballot, but has told voters to pretend that he is. His visibility makes his character and exercise of power a central issue at a time of career-low approval ratings and a swirl of controversies over corruption allegations and his various pet building projects.</p><p>Democrats have framed the midterms as an opportunity to rein in the president.</p><hr><figure id=\"4fa7e3f8-65c2-44ac-adf8-5a762a474ce4\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-6\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a microchip\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"artificial-intelligence-and-datacenters\"><strong>Artificial intelligence and data</strong><strong>centers</strong></h2><p>AI has emerged as a key campaign issue, with surveys showing a majority of voters holding negative views on it, even as Trump champions its development and attempts to rename it “super intelligence”.</p><p>Up to 70% of Americans oppose the construction of AI datacenters in their areas, polls show.</p><hr><figure id=\"90304da8-5d74-478f-b66a-7da6967ffeec\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-7\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a ballot box\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"democracy\"><strong>Democracy</strong></h2><p>The elections will take place against a backdrop of uncertainty over whether Trump will try to interfere with the vote. The <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-supreme-court\" data-link-name=\"in body link\">US supreme court</a> last month rejected his bid to restrict mail-in ballots, triggering an intensification of unfounded accusations from him about election fraud.</p><hr></div></article></DIV>","content_text":"Illustration: Guardian DesignNext month’s midterm elections will test Donald Trump’s second term and determine whether Democrats regain political power in Washington. Polls show Trump’s approval ratings at their lowest across his two presidencies, pulled down by widespread economic dissatisfaction and an unpopular war against Iran. Here are the key issues shaping this year’s elections.The economyDespite Trump’s 2024 campaign pledge to tackle affordability issues, the economy consistently ranks as voters’ top concern. A recent Associated Press-NORC survey showed only 26% of voters approving of Trump’s handling of the economy, two percentage points below Joe Biden’s worst ratings on the issue.IranTrump’s decision to go to war with the Tehran regime has exacerbated economic worries. Iran’s retaliatory decision to close the strait of Hormuz has driven up gasoline prices for US motorists.It also represents a breach of his pledge to end the US’s supposed addiction to “forever wars”. Democrats and some Republicans also complain that he embarked on military action without congressional authorization.ImmigrationEnforcement and closing the border remains a signature issue for Trump. He repeatedly boasts of the impact of his closure of the southern border as one of his biggest achievements, making comparisons with the performance of Joe Biden.But the mood has since shifted. High profile violent incidents involving Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) and Customs and Border Protection agents have fed a perception that the immigration crackdown has “gone too far”.Trump’s powerThe president is not on the ballot, but has told voters to pretend that he is. His visibility makes his character and exercise of power a central issue at a time of career-low approval ratings and a swirl of controversies over corruption allegations and his various pet building projects.Democrats have framed the midterms as an opportunity to rein in the president.Artificial intelligence and datacentersAI has emerged as a key campaign issue, with surveys showing a majority of voters holding negative views on it, even as Trump champions its development and attempts to rename it “super intelligence”.Up to 70% of Americans oppose the construction of AI datacenters in their areas, polls show.DemocracyThe elections will take place against a backdrop of uncertainty over whether Trump will try to interfere with the vote. The US supreme court last month rejected his bid to restrict mail-in ballots, triggering an intensification of unfounded accusations from him about election fraud.","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:11:42.889Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<figcaption data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\"><span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 13\"><path d=\"M18 3.5v8l-1.5 1.5h-15l-1.5-1.5v-8l1.5-1.5h3.5l2-2h4l2 2h3.5l1.5 1.5zm-9 7.5c1.9 0 3.5-1.6 3.5-3.5s-1.6-3.5-3.5-3.5-3.5 1.6-3.5 3.5 1.6 3.5 3.5 3.5z\" /></svg></span> Illustration: Guardian Design</figcaption>","sentences":[{"en":"Illustration: Guardian Design","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Next month’s<a href=\"https://viewer.gutools.co.uk/us-news/us-midterm-elections-2026\" data-link-name=\"in body link\"> midterm elections</a> will test <a href=\"https://viewer.gutools.co.uk/us-news/donaldtrump\" data-link-name=\"in body link\">Donald Trump’</a>s second term and determine whether Democrats regain political power in Washington. Polls show Trump’s approval ratings at their lowest across his two presidencies, pulled down by widespread economic dissatisfaction and an unpopular war against <a href=\"https://viewer.gutools.co.uk/world/iran\" data-link-name=\"in body link\">Iran</a>. Here are the key issues shaping this year’s elections.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Next month’s midterm elections will test Donald Trump’s second term and determine whether Democrats regain political power in Washington.","zh":null},{"en":"Polls show Trump’s approval ratings at their lowest across his two presidencies, pulled down by widespread economic dissatisfaction and an unpopular war against Iran.","zh":null},{"en":"Here are the key issues shaping this year’s elections.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"the-economy\"><strong>The economy</strong></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"The economy","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Despite Trump’s 2024 campaign pledge to tackle affordability issues, the economy consistently ranks as voters’ top concern. A recent Associated Press-NORC survey showed only 26% of voters approving of Trump’s handling of the economy, two percentage points below Joe Biden’s worst ratings on the issue.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Despite Trump’s 2024 campaign pledge to tackle affordability issues, the economy consistently ranks as voters’ top concern.","zh":null},{"en":"A recent Associated Press-NORC survey showed only 26% of voters approving of Trump’s handling of the economy, two percentage points below Joe Biden’s worst ratings on the issue.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"iran\"><strong>Iran</strong></h2>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>Trump’s decision to go to war with the Tehran regime has exacerbated economic worries. Iran’s retaliatory decision to close the strait of Hormuz has driven up gasoline prices for US motorists.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Trump’s decision to go to war with the Tehran regime has exacerbated economic worries.","zh":null},{"en":"Iran’s retaliatory decision to close the strait of Hormuz has driven up gasoline prices for US motorists.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>It also represents a breach of his pledge to end the US’s supposed addiction to “forever wars”. Democrats and some Republicans also complain that he embarked on military action without congressional authorization.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"It also represents a breach of his pledge to end the US’s supposed addiction to “forever wars”.","zh":null},{"en":"Democrats and some Republicans also complain that he embarked on military action without congressional authorization.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"immigration\"><strong>Immigration</strong></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Immigration","zh":"移民"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Enforcement and closing the border remains a signature issue for Trump. He repeatedly boasts of the impact of his closure of the southern border as one of his biggest achievements, making comparisons with the performance of Joe Biden.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Enforcement and closing the border remains a signature issue for Trump.","zh":null},{"en":"He repeatedly boasts of the impact of his closure of the southern border as one of his biggest achievements, making comparisons with the performance of Joe Biden.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>But the mood has since shifted. High profile violent incidents involving Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) and Customs and Border Protection agents have fed a perception that the immigration crackdown has “gone too far”.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"But the mood has since shifted.","zh":null},{"en":"High profile violent incidents involving Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) and Customs and Border Protection agents have fed a perception that the immigration crackdown has “gone too far”.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"trumps-power\"><strong>Trump’s power</strong></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Trump’s power","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>The president is not on the ballot, but has told voters to pretend that he is. His visibility makes his character and exercise of power a central issue at a time of career-low approval ratings and a swirl of controversies over corruption allegations and his various pet building projects.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The president is not on the ballot, but has told voters to pretend that he is.","zh":null},{"en":"His visibility makes his character and exercise of power a central issue at a time of career-low approval ratings and a swirl of controversies over corruption allegations and his various pet building projects.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Democrats have framed the midterms as an opportunity to rein in the president.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Democrats have framed the midterms as an opportunity to rein in the president.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"artificial-intelligence-and-datacenters\"><strong>Artificial intelligence and data</strong><strong>centers</strong></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Artificial intelligence and datacenters","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>AI has emerged as a key campaign issue, with surveys showing a majority of voters holding negative views on it, even as Trump champions its development and attempts to rename it “super intelligence”.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"AI has emerged as a key campaign issue, with surveys showing a majority of voters holding negative views on it, even as Trump champions its development and attempts to rename it “super intelligence”.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Up to 70% of Americans oppose the construction of AI datacenters in their areas, polls show.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Up to 70% of Americans oppose the construction of AI datacenters in their areas, polls show.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"democracy\"><strong>Democracy</strong></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Democracy","zh":"民主"}]},{"html_en":"<p>The elections will take place against a backdrop of uncertainty over whether Trump will try to interfere with the vote. The <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-supreme-court\" data-link-name=\"in body link\">US supreme court</a> last month rejected his bid to restrict mail-in ballots, triggering an intensification of unfounded accusations from him about election fraud.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The elections will take place against a backdrop of uncertainty over whether Trump will try to interfere with the vote.","zh":null},{"en":"The US supreme court last month rejected his bid to restrict mail-in ballots, triggering an intensification of unfounded accusations from him about election fraud.","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><article data-gu-name=\"body\"><div id=\"maincontent\"><figure id=\"a9c5be52-947b-4122-baf0-3f37730f43ae\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.InteractiveAtomBlockElement\"></figure><figure id=\"61988c72-986d-4839-9309-2145e851179e\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.EmbedBlockElement\"><gu-island name=\"UnsafeEmbedBlockComponent\" priority=\"feature\" deferUntil=\"visible\" props=\"{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;<div class=\\&quot;interactive\\&quot; data-props='{\\&quot;element\\&quot;:\\&quot;snap-slides\\&quot;,\\&quot;theme\\&quot;:\\&quot;feature-light\\&quot;}'></div>&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Layered red, white and blue paper cutouts depicting Trump, an ICE agent, a ballot box, a piggy bank, a fuel pump and a microchip&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:1,&quot;isTracking&quot;:false,&quot;isMainMedia&quot;:false}\"></gu-island></figure><hr><figure id=\"b4b541df-0d06-4381-bba2-ea90a2da15cc\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-1\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Colored Paper\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d14ac70148324b753cca0c06e688e106f389a2c3/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div><figcaption data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\">Illustration: Guardian Design</figcaption></figure><p>Next month’s midterm elections will test Donald Trump’s second term and determine whether Democrats regain political power in Washington. Polls show Trump’s approval ratings at their lowest across his two presidencies, pulled down by widespread economic dissatisfaction and an unpopular war against Iran. Here are the key issues shaping this year’s elections.</p><hr><figure id=\"6d20e853-5e1e-4c9e-b625-527b49c6470d\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-2\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a piggy bank\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/25cdf45a709db8262f0b83d3ea0f4a63671621fd/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"the-economy\">The economy</h2><p>Despite Trump’s 2024 campaign pledge to tackle affordability issues, the economy consistently ranks as voters’ top concern. A recent Associated Press-NORC survey showed only 26% of voters approving of Trump’s handling of the economy, two percentage points below Joe Biden’s worst ratings on the issue.</p><hr><figure id=\"954282a1-c877-457e-bd96-e3481f4c7443\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-3\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a fuel pump\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/76bd071a4afe86d194f6d8ba9f714533e4062103/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"iran\"><strong>Iran</strong></h2><p>Trump’s decision to go to war with the Tehran regime has exacerbated economic worries. Iran’s retaliatory decision to close the strait of Hormuz has driven up gasoline prices for US motorists.</p><p>It also represents a breach of his pledge to end the US’s supposed addiction to “forever wars”. Democrats and some Republicans also complain that he embarked on military action without congressional authorization.</p><hr><figure id=\"e97385b8-b6bd-45ad-b14d-1a5e260aac54\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-4\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of an ICE agent\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7066f31c75d9841eca745a7f527d35a6fe8cd327/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"immigration\">移民</h2><p>Enforcement and closing the border remains a signature issue for Trump. He repeatedly boasts of the impact of his closure of the southern border as one of his biggest achievements, making comparisons with the performance of Joe Biden.</p><p>But the mood has since shifted. High profile violent incidents involving Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) and Customs and Border Protection agents have fed a perception that the immigration crackdown has “gone too far”.</p><hr><figure id=\"8b3fe089-0a25-49e3-aaf3-abd5df698cff\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-5\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of Trump’s profile\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/45b45f19187595265829e5cd4262c6693677dc08/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"trumps-power\">Trump’s power</h2><p>The president is not on the ballot, but has told voters to pretend that he is. His visibility makes his character and exercise of power a central issue at a time of career-low approval ratings and a swirl of controversies over corruption allegations and his various pet building projects.</p><p>Democrats have framed the midterms as an opportunity to rein in the president.</p><hr><figure id=\"4fa7e3f8-65c2-44ac-adf8-5a762a474ce4\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-6\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a microchip\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5bdcff61ba3b7f941aad1097c2fc2d0e28c97c71/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"artificial-intelligence-and-datacenters\">Artificial intelligence and datacenters</h2><p>AI has emerged as a key campaign issue, with surveys showing a majority of voters holding negative views on it, even as Trump champions its development and attempts to rename it “super intelligence”.</p><p>Up to 70% of Americans oppose the construction of AI datacenters in their areas, polls show.</p><hr><figure id=\"90304da8-5d74-478f-b66a-7da6967ffeec\" data-spacefinder-role=\"inline\" data-spacefinder-type=\"model.dotcomrendering.pageElements.ImageBlockElement\"><div id=\"img-7\"><picture><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 660px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 660px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 480px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=605&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 480px)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.25), (min-width: 320px) and (min-resolution: 120dpi)\"><source srcSet=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" media=\"(min-width: 320px)\"><img alt=\"Red, white and blue layered paper cutout of a ballot box\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/cb8ced10bd9d2fc191290fbac499cc09cc8d0d05/0_0_4000_6000/master/4000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none\" width=\"445\" height=\"667.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div></figure><h2 id=\"democracy\">民主</h2><p>The elections will take place against a backdrop of uncertainty over whether Trump will try to interfere with the vote. The US supreme court last month rejected his bid to restrict mail-in ballots, triggering an intensification of unfounded accusations from him about election fraud.</p><hr></div></article></div>"}